\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cb5\highlight5 The {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://66E83FF3-B22F-4B61-86F6-E8B9EE57AD5C"}{\fldrsltgates}} are a culmination of newly found and orchestrated materials developed by the sentient in their time underground. For this reason the material scans never appeared on any registered database. While this would have usually been a massive flag on exporatory systems, the passing and timing of the ring passing through serves merely as a reflection of several passing asteroids in the system, undocumented and unregistered. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cb5\highlight5 The rings in sleeping cold state, used a quantum state light absorber, this incoming light state on the crude surface like blanket of the organism like structure, would absorb the light, it literally cloaked and adjusted the outer volumes of the ship to appear in state like another asteroid or mass. In reality what had been pre planned had been set in motion in the far belts only a decade ago. }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cb5\highlight5 Transmission How the {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://55C0B010-AA9B-40FD-9908-5B3975BFF2EB"}{\fldrsltGates}} Work }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cb5\highlight5 How the {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://1489DBD3-8C5F-4380-9B5F-4C8DE448C837"}{\fldrsltgates}} work. Notes. the entire process is a result of data transmission. in combination with sentient engineering. While thetravel is not instantaneous as such data transmission is. The {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://99EC40A4-55A7-4C35-A3CA-CDDA88D63F72"}{\fldrsltgates}} hold a reserve of all the elements know to man and machine. This reserve is large enough to produce anything that fits within. The {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://7BCC31BD-CE62-4058-BEA2-FC45660D4C37"}{\fldrsltgates}} circa ference. the scale of the {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://D1661521-9027-4C8D-98D9-3699BD7726F6"}{\fldrsltgates}} span 10 football fields across and the ring edges themselves a whole 2 football fields.}
